{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:37 2026-11-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:37 2026-11-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:37 2026-11-23 HKT</p><img alt=\"筲箕灣愛東邨單位起火 居民急疏散 消防趕至救熄\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95681046b35ce25f8142ccbd2aa0b929/2026-11/collage_82.jpg\"/><p>筲箕灣愛東邨愛澤樓，今日（11月23日）晚上10時許有中層單位起火冒煙，大批居民聞火警鐘聲大作，急忙疏散至樓下暫避，並報警求助。警方消防接報後趕至，火警其後迅速被救熄，起火原因仍在調查。</p><img alt=\"現場為筲箕灣愛東邨愛澤樓。FB：Kenny Lam Yung Kit\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dca19333775d251eb094b00d5c1c7b92/2026-11/926395856_10165201994853620_7842524771155848062_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"中層一單位冒煙。FB：Kenny Lam Yung Kit\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ffd9c2a3645b93e33eec5f4c9c5a2de7/2026-11/926565593_10165201995453620_8763737865328510606_n_1_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"大批居民疏散。FB：筲箕灣人筲箕灣事\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e64952e6d2b9c4c405689be91fd99c0f/2026-11/926188330_10165134454381684_2303828014540699600_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。FB：筲箕灣人筲箕灣事\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9af793ef957cab9b7c46364a4fb50791/2026-11/3_0_59.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。FB：筲箕灣人筲箕灣事\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e6954eaa79f4c7471071fcdcf3bd7d4/2026-11/920824187_3333416626845009_4975143237987078896_n.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:56:02.333380+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:37:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T21:14:44.091276+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:34.475090+00:00","content_hash":"f2a25f39e95179b62d602c647756b8e4b04bbc3ffbc7d8c134dc14b81c5a6666","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}